  "description": "Pair three visible-edge arms at L=5 with the three visible arms at R. Omitting the existing hidden LR from the colored local tripods can invite treating L/R as the apex pair, transferring5 toR and1 to the other three vertices, giving2*5+3*1=13. The black hiddenLR visibly refutes that degree3 role; the true apices areT/B.",
